<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1750"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bodycheck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bodycheck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 11, 2004 - 12:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Is it just me or does this imply that he knew WHO he was looking for, perhaps from a social interaction or a worksite interaction....but NOT a personal one... <BR> <BR>This just screams that he was lookin for her specifically, and had already planned her ... <BR> <BR>This also suggests that there is some other connection between the victims... I mean its not completely random...the guy KNEW who he was looking for... <BR> <BR>Somehow, someway, there is something that ties these folks together... <BR> <BR>Sorry for the length...first post...been reading this board for a couple weeks....fascinating.. <BR> <BR>B <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
